<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<bpmn:definitions xmlns:bpmn="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/MODEL" xmlns:bpmndi="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/DI" xmlns:dc="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DC" xmlns:di="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DI" id="Definitions_PA-29.2-financial-and-operational-masters" targetNamespace="https://erpplans.local/bpmn" exporter="erpplans generate-bpmn.py" exporterVersion="1.0">
    <bpmn:process id="W_W288" name="W288. Financial Master Data Governance (COA &amp; Cost Centers)" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Business expansion, new department creation, or annual budget preparation requiring new GL accounts or Cost Centers
Frequency: Monthly (for Cost Centers), Annually/Quarterly (for GL Accounts)
Volume: ~5–10 cost center changes/month; ~10–20 GL account changes/year
Owner: Corporate Controller
Participants: Finance Controller, Department Head, FP&amp;A Manager, IT ERP Administrator
Source: workflow W288 — Financial Master Data Governance (COA &amp; Cost Centers)</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W288_LaneSet6">
        <bpmn:lane id="W288_Lane1" name="Finance Controller">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W288_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W288_Start7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W288_Lane2" name="FP&amp;A Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W288_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W288_Lane3" name="Corporate Controller">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W288_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W288_Lane4" name="IT ERP Administrator">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W288_Task11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W288_Lane5" name="System">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W288_Task12</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W288_End13</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W288_Start7" name="Business expansion, new department creation, or annual budget preparation requiring new…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W288_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W288_Task8" name="Request Initiation">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Request Initiation: Department Head or Finance Controller submits a request for a new Cost Center or GL Account via the MDM/Finance portal, providing justification and mapping details.
Responsible (R): Finance Controller
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 15 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W288_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W288_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W288_Task9" name="Review &amp; Standardization">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Review &amp; Standardization: FP&amp;A Manager reviews the request against the standardized Chart of Accounts structure to prevent proliferation and ensure consistency across the 5 legal entities.
Responsible (R): FP&amp;A Manager
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 20 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W288_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W288_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W288_Task10" name="Approval">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Approval: Corporate Controller approves the creation of the new financial master data object, confirming alignment with financial reporting standards and tax requirements.
Responsible (R): Corporate Controller
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: 10 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W288_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W288_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W288_Task11" name="System Setup &amp; Mapping">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: System Setup &amp; Mapping: IT ERP Administrator configures the new cost center as an accounting-flexfield cost-center segment value in the CoA, assigns it to its parent roll-up group for financial-statement reporting, sets cross-validation and security rules, and maps it to the relevant financial statement roll-ups.
Responsible (R): IT ERP Administrator
Accountable (A): Corporate Controller
Duration: 30 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W288_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W288_Flow20</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W288_Task12" name="Communication">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Communication: System notifies relevant stakeholders (Finance, Operations) that the new financial master data is available for use in POs, invoices, and journal entries.
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W288_Flow20</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W288_Flow21</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W288_End13" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W288_Flow21</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W288_Annotation14">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-329 (ensure controlled execution — Financial &amp; Operational Masters (PA-29.2).) | - operational: Corporate Controller review and approval gate
Owner: Corporate Controller</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W288_Assoc15" sourceRef="W288_Annotation14" targetRef="W288_Start7" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W288_Flow16" sourceRef="W288_Start7" targetRef="W288_Task8" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W288_Flow17" sourceRef="W288_Task8" targetRef="W288_Task9" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W288_Flow18" sourceRef="W288_Task9" targetRef="W288_Task10" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W288_Flow19" sourceRef="W288_Task10" targetRef="W288_Task11" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W288_Flow20" sourceRef="W288_Task11" targetRef="W288_Task12" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W288_Flow21" sourceRef="W288_Task12" targetRef="W288_End13" />
    </bpmn:process>
    <bpmndi:BPMNDiagram id="W288_diag">
      <bpmndi:BPMNPlane id="W288_plane" bpmnElement="W_W288">
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W288_Lane1_di" bpmnElement="W288_Lane1" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="160" y="80" width="1370" height="170" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W288_Lane2_di" bpmnElement="W288_Lane2" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="160" y="250" width="1370" height="170" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W288_Lane3_di" bpmnElement="W288_Lane3" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="160" y="420" width="1370" height="170" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W288_Lane4_di" bpmnElement="W288_Lane4" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="160" y="590" width="1370" height="170" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W288_Lane5_di" bpmnElement="W288_Lane5" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="160" y="760" width="1370" height="170" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W288_Task8_di" bpmnElement="W288_Task8"><dc:Bounds x="400" y="125" width="180" height="80" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W288_Task9_di" bpmnElement="W288_Task9"><dc:Bounds x="610" y="295" width="180" height="80" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W288_Task10_di" bpmnElement="W288_Task10"><dc:Bounds x="820" y="465" width="180" height="80" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W288_Task11_di" bpmnElement="W288_Task11"><dc:Bounds x="1030" y="635" width="180" height="80" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W288_Task12_di" bpmnElement="W288_Task12"><dc:Bounds x="1240" y="805" width="180" height="80" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W288_Start7_di" bpmnElement="W288_Start7"><dc:Bounds x="290" y="147" width="36" height="36" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W288_End13_di" bpmnElement="W288_End13"><dc:Bounds x="1470" y="827" width="36" height="36" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W288_Annotation14_di" bpmnElement="W288_Annotation14"><dc:Bounds x="160" y="970" width="360" height="60" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="W288_Flow16_di" bpmnElement="W288_Flow16"><di:waypoint x="326" y="165" /><di:waypoint x="400" y="165" /></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
        <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="W288_Flow17_di" bpmnElement="W288_Flow17"><di:waypoint x="580" y="165" /><di:waypoint x="610" y="335" /></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
        <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="W288_Flow18_di" bpmnElement="W288_Flow18"><di:waypoint x="790" y="335" /><di:waypoint x="820" y="505" /></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
        <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="W288_Flow19_di" bpmnElement="W288_Flow19"><di:waypoint x="1000" y="505" /><di:waypoint x="1030" y="675" /></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
        <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="W288_Flow20_di" bpmnElement="W288_Flow20"><di:waypoint x="1210" y="675" /><di:waypoint x="1240" y="845" /></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
        <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="W288_Flow21_di" bpmnElement="W288_Flow21"><di:waypoint x="1420" y="845" /><di:waypoint x="1470" y="845" /></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
        <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="W288_Assoc15_di" bpmnElement="W288_Assoc15"><di:waypoint x="340" y="970" /><di:waypoint x="308" y="183" /></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      </bpmndi:BPMNPlane>
    </bpmndi:BPMNDiagram>
    <bpmn:process id="W_W289" name="W289. Pricing Master Governance (Base Prices &amp; Matrices)" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Initial setup of pricing rules, creation of new price lists, or structural changes to store/region pricing matrices
Frequency: Monthly structural updates; Daily operational price changes (handled in W40/W13)
Volume: ~2–5 structural matrix changes/month
Owner: VP Merchandising
Participants: Pricing Manager, Category Manager, Master Data Manager
Source: workflow W289 — Pricing Master Governance (Base Prices &amp; Matrices)</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W289_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W289_Lane1" name="Pricing Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W289_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W289_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W289_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W289_Lane2" name="Master Data Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W289_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W289_Lane3" name="VP Merchandising">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W289_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W289_End10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W289_Start5" name="Initial setup of pricing rules, creation of new price lists, or structural changes to…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W289_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W289_Task6" name="Strategy Definition">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Strategy Definition: Pricing Manager defines structural rules for a new base price list or regional markup matrix based on margin targets.
Responsible (R): Pricing Manager
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W289_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W289_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W289_Task7" name="Validation &amp; Margin Simulation">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Validation &amp; Margin Simulation: Master Data Manager reviews the matrix logic against existing promotional rules. System runs a sandbox simulation using historical 90-day basket data to project the overall margin impact and identify margin bleed.
Responsible (R): Master Data Manager
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 30 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W289_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W289_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W289_Task8" name="Approval">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Approval: VP Merchandising reviews the margin simulation output and approves the new pricing master structure (MDM-005).
Responsible (R): VP Merchandising
Accountable (A): VP Merchandising
Duration: 10 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W289_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W289_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W289_Task9" name="System Configuration">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: System Configuration: Pricing Manager configs the new list in ERP, setting effective dates and linking it to the relevant Location Master (W254) hierarchies or Customer Trade accounts.
Responsible (R): Pricing Manager
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 45 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W289_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W289_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W289_End10" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W289_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W289_Annotation11">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-53 (ensure pricing master integrity.) | - operational: VP Merchandising review and approval gate
Owner: VP Merchandising</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W289_Assoc12" sourceRef="W289_Annotation11" targetRef="W289_Start5" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W289_Flow13" sourceRef="W289_Start5" targetRef="W289_Task6" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W289_Flow14" sourceRef="W289_Task6" targetRef="W289_Task7" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W289_Flow15" sourceRef="W289_Task7" targetRef="W289_Task8" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W289_Flow16" sourceRef="W289_Task8" targetRef="W289_Task9" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W289_Flow17" sourceRef="W289_Task9" targetRef="W289_End10" />
    </bpmn:process>
    <bpmndi:BPMNDiagram id="W289_diag">
      <bpmndi:BPMNPlane id="W289_plane" bpmnElement="W_W289">
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W289_Lane1_di" bpmnElement="W289_Lane1" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="160" y="80" width="1160" height="170" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W289_Lane2_di" bpmnElement="W289_Lane2" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="160" y="250" width="1160" height="170" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W289_Lane3_di" bpmnElement="W289_Lane3" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="160" y="420" width="1160" height="170" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W289_Task6_di" bpmnElement="W289_Task6"><dc:Bounds x="400" y="125" width="180" height="80" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W289_Task7_di" bpmnElement="W289_Task7"><dc:Bounds x="610" y="295" width="180" height="80" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W289_Task8_di" bpmnElement="W289_Task8"><dc:Bounds x="820" y="465" width="180" height="80" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W289_Task9_di" bpmnElement="W289_Task9"><dc:Bounds x="1030" y="125" width="180" height="80" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W289_Start5_di" bpmnElement="W289_Start5"><dc:Bounds x="290" y="147" width="36" height="36" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W289_End10_di" bpmnElement="W289_End10"><dc:Bounds x="1260" y="487" width="36" height="36" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W289_Annotation11_di" bpmnElement="W289_Annotation11"><dc:Bounds x="160" y="630" width="360" height="60" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="W289_Flow13_di" bpmnElement="W289_Flow13"><di:waypoint x="326" y="165" /><di:waypoint x="400" y="165" /></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
        <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="W289_Flow14_di" bpmnElement="W289_Flow14"><di:waypoint x="580" y="165" /><di:waypoint x="610" y="335" /></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
        <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="W289_Flow15_di" bpmnElement="W289_Flow15"><di:waypoint x="790" y="335" /><di:waypoint x="820" y="505" /></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
        <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="W289_Flow16_di" bpmnElement="W289_Flow16"><di:waypoint x="1000" y="505" /><di:waypoint x="1030" y="165" /></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
        <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="W289_Flow17_di" bpmnElement="W289_Flow17"><di:waypoint x="1210" y="165" /><di:waypoint x="1260" y="505" /></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
        <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="W289_Assoc12_di" bpmnElement="W289_Assoc12"><di:waypoint x="340" y="630" /><di:waypoint x="308" y="183" /></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      </bpmndi:BPMNPlane>
    </bpmndi:BPMNDiagram>
    <bpmn:process id="W_W293" name="W293. Tax &amp; Regulatory Master Data Governance" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: BIR revenue regulation update, new tax code issuance, VAT/WHT rate change, LGU tax ordinance amendment, or annual tax table refresh
Frequency: As-needed (typically 2–4 BIR updates/year); Annual tax table refresh (January)
Volume: ~2–4 regulatory updates/year; ~1 annual full refresh; ~200 ATC codes maintained
Owner: Tax Manager
Participants: Corporate Controller, Finance Controller, IT ERP Administrator, Master Data Analyst
Source: workflow W293 — Tax &amp; Regulatory Master Data Governance</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W293_LaneSet5">
        <bpmn:lane id="W293_Lane1" name="Tax Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W293_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W293_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W293_Task12</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W293_Task13</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W293_Start6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W293_Lane2" name="Finance Controller">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W293_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W293_Lane3" name="IT ERP Administrator">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W293_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W293_Lane4" name="Master Data Analyst">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W293_Task11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W293_End14</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W293_Start6" name="BIR revenue regulation update, new tax code issuance, VAT/WHT rate change, LGU tax…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W293_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W293_Task7" name="Regulatory Change Monitoring">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Regulatory Change Monitoring: Tax Manager monitors BIR Revenue Regulations, Revenue Memorandum Orders (RMOs), and LGU tax ordinances. When a change is identified, Tax Manager creates a Tax Master Change Request specifying the affected tax codes, rates, and effective dates.
Responsible (R): Tax Manager
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 30 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W293_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W293_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W293_Task8" name="Impact Assessment">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Impact Assessment: Finance Controller assesses the impact on existing transactions — identifying open POs, pending invoices, and active promotional pricing affected by the rate change. Master Data Analyst identifies all vendor/customer records linked to the affected ATC codes.
Responsible (R): Finance Controller / Master Data Analyst
Accountable (A): Corporate Controller
Duration: 2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W293_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W293_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W293_Task9" name="Tax Code Configuration">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Tax Code Configuration: IT ERP Administrator configures the new tax code or rate in the ERP Tax Master, specifying: effective date, tax type (VAT, EWT, percentage tax), rate, ATC code, BIR form mapping (2550M, 2550Q, 1601-EQ, 1601-C), and GL account for posting. System maintains both old and new rates with effective dating to handle transition-period transactions.
Responsible (R): IT ERP Administrator
Accountable (A): Tax Manager
Duration: 1 hour</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W293_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W293_Flow20</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W293_Task10" name="Validation &amp; Testing">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Validation &amp; Testing: Tax Manager runs test transactions (sample AP invoice, sample POS sale, sample payroll) using the new tax configuration to verify correct computation and GL posting. Corporate Controller reviews the test results.
Responsible (R): Tax Manager
Accountable (A): Corporate Controller
Duration: 1 hour</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W293_Flow20</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W293_Flow21</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W293_Task11" name="Vendor/Customer Record Update">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Vendor/Customer Record Update: Master Data Analyst bulk-updates vendor and customer records affected by the ATC code change. System generates a change log listing all records modified.
Responsible (R): Master Data Analyst
Accountable (A): Tax Manager
Duration: 2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W293_Flow21</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W293_Flow22</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W293_Task12" name="Activation &amp; Communication">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 6: Activation &amp; Communication: Tax Manager activates the new tax master configuration effective on the regulatory deadline. System notifies AP Clerks, Store Managers, and Payroll Officers of the change with a summary of affected codes.
Responsible (R): Tax Manager
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 30 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W293_Flow22</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W293_Flow23</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W293_Task13" name="Post-Implementation Review">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 7: Post-Implementation Review: Within the first month after activation, Tax Manager reviews a sample of transactions to verify correct tax application and BIR form generation.
Responsible (R): Tax Manager
Accountable (A): Corporate Controller
Duration: 2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W293_Flow23</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W293_Flow24</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W293_End14" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W293_Flow24</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W293_Annotation15">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-55 (ensure tax &amp; regulatory master data accuracy.) | - operational: Tax Manager review and approval gate
Owner: Tax Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W293_Assoc16" sourceRef="W293_Annotation15" targetRef="W293_Start6" associationDirection="None" />
