    <bpmn:process id="W_W1545" name="W1545. Cost Center &amp; Profit Center Hierarchy Governance, Allocation Rule Review &amp; Reporting Validation" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Annual chart of accounts review; or new store opening (W16); or organizational restructuring; or new reporting requirement from FP&amp;A
Frequency: Annual full review; ad-hoc changes as needed (new stores, restructuring)
Volume: ~300–400 cost centers; ~210 profit centers (200 stores + 4 DCs + HQ departments + 5 entities)
Owner: FP&amp;A Manager
Participants: FP&amp;A Manager, Finance Controller, IT Finance Lead, CFO, Department Heads
Source: workflow W1545 — Cost Center &amp; Profit Center Hierarchy Governance, Allocation Rule Review &amp; Reporting Validation</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W1545_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W1545_Lane1" name="FP&amp;A Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1545_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1545_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1545_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1545_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1545_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1545_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1545_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1545_End10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W1545_Start3" name="Annual chart of accounts review; or new store opening (W16); or organizational…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1545_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1545_Task4" name="Annual hierarchy review">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Annual hierarchy review: FP&amp;A Manager conducts annual review of entire cost/profit center hierarchy — (a) validates that all 200 stores have active profit centers with correct entity assignment; (b) reviews department cost centers against current organizational chart; (c) identifies unused/orphan cost centers (no transactions in 12 months); (d) assesses allocation rule accuracy (are shared costs being allocated correctly?); (e) identifies gaps where new reporting dimensions are needed
Responsible (R): FP&amp;A Manager
Accountable (A): Finance Controller
Duration: 16 hours/year</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1545_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1545_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1545_Task5" name="New cost/profit center creation">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: New cost/profit center creation: For new stores (W16), new departments, or organizational changes — FP&amp;A Manager submits creation request to IT Finance Lead: center code, description, parent hierarchy, entity assignment, responsible manager, valid-from date; IT Finance Lead creates the value in the accounting flexfield — cost-center segment under the department roll-up group for HQ cost centers, the store hierarchy&#x27;s profit-center segment for stores — validating the company × cost-center cross-validation rule per entity; Finance Controller approves; system propagates to all downstream reporting modules
Responsible (R): FP&amp;A Manager / IT Finance Lead
Accountable (A): Finance Controller
Duration: 30 min/center</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1545_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1545_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1545_Task6" name="Cost center retirement">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Cost center retirement: For closed stores (W703), eliminated departments, or merged entities — FP&amp;A Manager initiates retirement: (a) validates no open commitments or budgets, (b) redirects pending transactions to successor center, (c) archives historical data for retention (10 years per BIR), (d) sets valid-to date; system blocks new transactions against retired center
Responsible (R): FP&amp;A Manager
Accountable (A): Finance Controller
Duration: 30 min/center</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1545_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1545_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1545_Task7" name="Allocation rule review &amp; testing">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Allocation rule review &amp; testing: FP&amp;A Manager reviews allocation rules for shared services costs (IT, HR, Finance, warehouse fees) — validates allocation bases (headcount, revenue, sqm, transaction volume) are current; tests allocation results against manual calculations for a sample of cost centers; adjusts allocation percentages based on actual cost drivers
Responsible (R): FP&amp;A Manager
Accountable (A): Finance Controller
Duration: 8 hours/quarter</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1545_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1545_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1545_Task8" name="Reporting validation">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Reporting validation: FP&amp;A Manager validates that cost/profit center hierarchy produces accurate financial reports — runs test consolidation (W9) on sandbox; verifies store P&amp;L accuracy for sample of 10 stores; checks intercompany allocation elimination; confirms entity-level reporting matches standalone entity books
Responsible (R): FP&amp;A Manager
Accountable (A): Finance Controller
Duration: 4 hours/quarter</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1545_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1545_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1545_Task9" name="Change communication">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 6: Change communication: For any hierarchy changes, FP&amp;A Manager communicates to affected stakeholders — Department Heads receive updated budget templates; Store Managers see corrected profit center assignment; IT Finance Lead publishes updated hierarchy documentation to finance team
Responsible (R): FP&amp;A Manager
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 2 hours/event</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1545_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1545_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W1545_End10" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W1545_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W1545_Annotation11">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-329 (ensure controlled execution — Financial &amp; Operational Masters (PA-29.2).) | - operational: FP&amp;A Manager review and approval gate
Owner: FP&amp;A Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W1545_Assoc12" sourceRef="W1545_Annotation11" targetRef="W1545_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
